flowchart LR
    Pkt["packet arrives<br/>at NIC"]
    XDP["your XDP program<br/>returns one of:"]

    Pass["XDP_PASS<br/>continue to stack<br/>(skb gets allocated)"]
    Drop["XDP_DROP<br/>free packet, done<br/>(no skb)"]
    Tx["XDP_TX<br/>send back out<br/>same interface"]
    Redirect["XDP_REDIRECT<br/>send out a different<br/>iface or AF_XDP socket"]
    Aborted["XDP_ABORTED<br/>error path<br/>same as DROP + tracepoint"]

    Pkt --> XDP
    XDP --> Pass
    XDP --> Drop
    XDP --> Tx
    XDP --> Redirect
    XDP --> Aborted

    Pass --> NetStack[("Linux net stack")]
    Drop --> Bin[("/dev/null")]
    Tx --> Wire[("back on wire")]
    Redirect --> Map["bpf_redirect_map<br/>(devmap, cpumap, xskmap)"]
    Map --> OtherIface[("other interface\nor AF_XDP socket")]
    Aborted --> Bin

    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    classDef hot fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    class Pass,Tx,Redirect ok
    class Drop,Aborted bad
    class XDP,Map hot
